1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
The library opens at nine on weekdays.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:07,600
You can borrow up to five books at a time.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Please keep your voice down in the reading room.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,400
There is a quiet desk by the window on the second floor.

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,000
If you need help, ask the librarian at the front desk.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:25,400
Books can be returned in the box outside the door.

7
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:29,700
You can use the computers for one hour each day.

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,900
The study group meets every Thursday afternoon.

9
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:38,200
Remember to bring your card when you visit next time.
